@FinancialTransaction.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5209

### Ao rodar a API em Development, um seeder cria automaticamente as contas
### ACC-001 e ACC-002 (se a tabela accounts estiver vazia). Use o endpoint
### abaixo para descobrir os IDs gerados e substituir nos exemplos seguintes.

### Listar todas as contas (200 OK)
GET {{FinancialTransaction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/accounts

### Resposta esperada (200 OK):
# [
#   { "id": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6", "number": "ACC-001" },
#   { "id": "7b2b1c9a-1234-4a2b-9abc-1234567890ab", "number": "ACC-002" }
# ]

### Criar transação (201 Created)
POST {{FinancialTransaction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "destinationAccountId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "amount": 250.50
}

### Resposta esperada (201 Created):
# {
#   "id": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
#   "sourceAccountId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
#   "destinationAccountId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
#   "amount": 250.50,
#   "status": "Pending",
#   "failureReason": null
# }
# Header Location: /api/transactions/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6

### Criar transação com conta inexistente (404 Not Found)
POST {{FinancialTransaction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999",
  "destinationAccountId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "amount": 100
}

### Resposta esperada (404 Not Found):
# {
#   "title": "Recurso não encontrado",
#   "status": 404,
#   "detail": "Conta de origem '99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999' não encontrada.",
#   "instance": "/api/transactions"
# }

### Criar transação com valor inválido (400 Bad Request)
POST {{FinancialTransaction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "destinationAccountId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "amount": 0
}

### Resposta esperada (400 Bad Request):
# {
#   "title": "Requisição inválida",
#   "status": 400,
#   "detail": "O valor da transação deve ser maior que zero.",
#   "instance": "/api/transactions"
# }

### Consultar transação por Id (200 OK)
GET {{FinancialTransaction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transactions/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6

### Consultar transação inexistente (404 Not Found)
GET {{FinancialTransaction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transactions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Listar todas as transações (200 OK)
GET {{FinancialTransaction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transactions
